{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……在」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随着濑名的搭话，我停止了自己的胡思乱想。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上好……怎么了吗？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么一脸认真地过来搭话……", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "莫不是和昨天校长的事情有关？", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我心里不由一紧。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然而。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「参考书选好了」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0794", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名从包里掏出大量的参考书，堆在了我的桌子上。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "濑名从包里掏出大量的参考书，堆在了我的桌子上。", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哎？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「班会不是还没开始吗，\\n　把现在的时间有效利用吧」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「班会不是还没开始吗，　把现在的时间有效利用吧」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0795", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她这是要……", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是要学习是嘛？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然了啦，昨天不是你说要让我继续教你学习吗」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「当然了啦，昨天不是你说要让我继续教你学习吗」", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0796", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来对于昨天我那句“能继续教我学习吗？”的请求，\\n濑名准备非常认真地对待。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "看来对于昨天我那句“能继续教我学习吗？”的请求，濑名准备非常认真地对待。", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是这个量可不是开玩笑的……", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确，提出请求的是我。而且在她评价我“好教”之后，\\n我也确实希望多向她讨教。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "的确，提出请求的是我。而且在她评价我“好教”之后，我也确实希望多向她讨教。", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是这才期中考试刚过，\\n紧接着就是这种强度还是有点……", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "但是这才期中考试刚过，紧接着就是这种强度还是有点……", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0797", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「坐下」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0798", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，很好」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0799", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到我立刻提供了所谓的“良性反馈”，\\n濑名表示很满意，露出了开心的笑容。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "看到我立刻提供了所谓的“良性反馈”，濑名表示很满意，露出了开心的笑容。", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "算了……看到这样的笑颜也算是值了。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
