{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请多关照……」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，距离提出要求也就隔了一天啊。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是的，不管是从好的方面说还是从坏的说，\\n濑名爱理这个女孩也是过于认真了……", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "真是的，不管是从好的方面说还是从坏的说，濑名爱理这个女孩也是过于认真了……", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也许是我一直以来都小看她的认真了。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第一节课的课间。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，课间时间也来有效利用吧」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0801", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……诶？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦，还卖什么呆，方便一下不就得了嘛，完事了就快回来！」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "「好啦，还卖什么呆，方便一下不就得了嘛，完事了就快回来！」", "plain_idx": 336, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0802", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇，知、知道了，别拽我啊……！」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈？！女、女仆我可是看到了！\\n　爱理同学要对新吾同学做一些不好的事了！」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "「哈？！女、女仆我可是看到了！　爱理同学要对新吾同学做一些不好的事了！」", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0328", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁要对瓜生施虐啊，我不过是被他拜托了，要我教他学习而已！」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「谁要对瓜生施虐啊，我不过是被他拜托了，要我教他学习而已！」", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0803", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二节课课间。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
