{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里不对，刚刚上课老师讲的你有认真听嘛？\\n　不是已经明示了这里会是重点吗」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": "「这里不对，刚刚上课老师讲的你有认真听嘛？　不是已经明示了这里会是重点吗」", "plain_idx": 349, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0804", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「发现新吾正在被审讯！」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0169", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「审讯是什么意思啊！\\n　不过是复习一下刚讲的东西而已」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「审讯是什么意思啊！　不过是复习一下刚讲的东西而已」", "plain_idx": 354, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0805", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
