{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……“实际上”是什么意思啊，瓜生」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0806", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，就是说从外人看来不太像是在学习……」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚考完试就来？哈～嗯。\\n　话说新吾新吾，刚才来的途中我看到了哟～」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "「刚考完试就来？哈～嗯。　话说新吾新吾，刚才来的途中我看到了哟～」", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0170", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0807", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，到这边来一下」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0808", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名突然起身，一把抓住我的手，把我拽了出去。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "濑名突然起身，一把抓住我的手，把我拽了出去。", "plain_idx": 366, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎——呀——」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要伪装成受害者到什么时候啊，别闹了快来……！」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "「你要伪装成受害者到什么时候啊，别闹了快来……！」", "plain_idx": 368, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0809", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈哈，隼太，回头再聊～……」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0171", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被带走了呢」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0329", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不是审讯而是洗脑吗？\\n　新吾那家伙根本不抵抗的嘛」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": "「……不是审讯而是洗脑吗？　新吾那家伙根本不抵抗的嘛」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0172", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁的秘密情报显示，上节课的课间就是那样的」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "「安洁的秘密情报显示，上节课的课间就是那样的」", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0330", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理那家伙也真是堕落了……\\n　男人什么的管他干嘛，更别说还是那个瓜生」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": "「爱理那家伙也真是堕落了……　男人什么的管他干嘛，更别说还是那个瓜生」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0118", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁非常在意，今后也将持续关注」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "「安洁非常在意，今后也将持续关注」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0331", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「加我一个。总觉得很有意思。\\n　跟考试之前气氛完全不一样了啊」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": "「加我一个。总觉得很有意思。　跟考试之前气氛完全不一样了啊」", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0173", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么就这样，纱纱等会再见了～」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0332", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，真是的！\\n　朋友落入了男人的毒手，我可不能眼睁睁地看着……！」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": "「喂，真是的！　朋友落入了男人的毒手，我可不能眼睁睁地看着……！」", "plain_idx": 391, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0119", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这不就是在看着吗？」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0333", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天就先饶他一会」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0120", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，这节课就这样……」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0096", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第三节课下课了。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「八冢老师」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0810", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是！」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0097", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？为啥新吾同学被濑名同学拉着过来了？！」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": "「诶？为啥新吾同学被濑名同学拉着过来了？！」", "plain_idx": 404, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0098", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「关于刚才讲的东西，有问题想请问老师」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0811", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也很疑惑忽然被拉走是要干什么……总之似乎她是来问问题的」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "「我也很疑惑忽然被拉走是要干什么……总之似乎她是来问问题的」", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师会被吓一跳也是难免。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，好的，这样啊。\\n　那当然没问题……我也是个老师来着」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": "「啊，好的，这样啊。　那当然没问题……我也是个老师来着」", "plain_idx": 411, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0099", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "搞清楚眼前的状况之后，万智老师也算是安稳了一些。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": "搞清楚眼前的状况之后，万智老师也算是安稳了一些。", "plain_idx": 413, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，有的时候我没什么自信……\\n　刚才让濑名同学叫住了，我还以为刚才哪里讲错了呢……」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": "「那个，有的时候我没什么自信……　刚才让濑名同学叫住了，我还以为刚才哪里讲错了呢……」", "plain_idx": 415, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0100", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师一下子又陷入了沮丧模式。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生快来帮我鼓励一下她！」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0812", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？诶～……啊～……」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个，万智老师的这一点我也很喜欢的」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！！」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0101", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是吗？那还真拿你没办法呢诶嘿，真是的，\\n　有什么问题就尽管问吧，老师一定会好好回答的～」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": "「是、是吗？那还真拿你没办法呢诶嘿，真是的，　有什么问题就尽管问吧，老师一定会好好回答的～」", "plain_idx": 425, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0102", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「有瓜生的话，和八冢老师交流起来也顺利一些了。\\n　只有我自己来的时候总觉得她畏畏缩缩的……」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": "%51;「有瓜生的话，和八冢老师交流起来也顺利一些了。　只有我自己来的时候总觉得她畏畏缩缩的……」", "plain_idx": 428, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0813", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就麻烦您了八冢老师，瓜生你要好好听明白」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": "「那就麻烦您了八冢老师，瓜生你要好好听明白」", "plain_idx": 430, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0814", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——那之后就是午休。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": "——那之后就是午休。", "plain_idx": 432, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「承蒙招待」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0815", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，瓜生」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0816", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，果然在这里也不放过我吗」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然了，要不为什么告诉你让你拿文具来啊」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": "「当然了，要不为什么告诉你让你拿文具来啊」", "plain_idx": 438, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0817", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看她的表情，好像在午休的时间学习是件很自然的事似的。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到此为止的一上午，只要一有时间她就看着我学习……", "text_idx": 441, "plain": "到此为止的一上午，只要一有时间她就看着我学习……", "plain_idx": 441, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这倒也没什么，只不过——", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「开始了开始了」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0334", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇，真的是在学习呢～小熊喵」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0208", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜！」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0074", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说在这里也这副模样啊……\\n　可惜，爱理已经没救了，只能放弃她了……」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": "「话说在这里也这副模样啊……　可惜，爱理已经没救了，只能放弃她了……」", "plain_idx": 452, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0121", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这就放弃了啊！\\n　哈哈哈哈，这不塑料姐妹花吗」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": "「这就放弃了啊！　哈哈哈哈，这不塑料姐妹花吗」", "plain_idx": 455, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0174", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过我们受到了所有人的围观。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从我个人角度上来说，\\n在这种场合里果然没法静下心来把大家撂在一边。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": "从我个人角度上来说，在这种场合里果然没法静下心来把大家撂在一边。", "plain_idx": 459, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……瓜生，现在好好学习可以吗？」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0818", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要不你就去跟大家聊天」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0819", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的表情应该没露出马脚，\\n但是濑名似乎把我给看穿了，别过了脸去。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": "我的表情应该没露出马脚，但是濑名似乎把我给看穿了，别过了脸去。", "plain_idx": 465, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愿意的话直接说就好了……」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0820", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她嘀嘀咕咕地说着，撅起的嘴角表达着内心的不满。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": "她嘀嘀咕咕地说着，撅起的嘴角表达着内心的不满。", "plain_idx": 468, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她是真心想帮我学习。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——她并不在意气氛，只不过气氛会因她的存在感而改变罢了。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": "——她并不在意气氛，只不过气氛会因她的存在感而改变罢了。", "plain_idx": 470, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而如今这种“存在”却仅仅只注视着我……", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那么，开始吧，有劳你了，濑名」", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于她这样的邀请，我的心中也仅能生出接受这唯一的选项。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": "对于她这样的邀请，我的心中也仅能生出接受这唯一的选项。", "plain_idx": 473, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "事情起始于我，但她很少主动地向我掷球。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": "事情起始于我，但她很少主动地向我掷球。", "plain_idx": 474, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以虽然有点对不住大家……\\n但是我必须负起责任来接好球。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": "所以虽然有点对不住大家……但是我必须负起责任来接好球。", "plain_idx": 476, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很好！那我可就不会手下留情了」", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0822", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈……还请不要太过严厉」", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，我们也要安静一些哟」", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0209", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，没事，不用顾忌我们」", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然还有种解决方式就是我们换个地方，\\n不过那样又显得有些刻意，结果还是就这样了。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": "当然还有种解决方式就是我们换个地方，不过那样又显得有些刻意，结果还是就这样了。", "plain_idx": 484, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你这么说我还觉得你碍眼呢！\\n　难得跟美羽学姐一起的快乐时光，我才不想要看见你那副认真学习的脸呢！」", "text_idx": 485, "plain": "「就算你这么说我还觉得你碍眼呢！　难得跟美羽学姐一起的快乐时光，我才不想要看见你那副认真学习的脸呢！」", "plain_idx": 486, "len": 53, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0122", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，纱凪！别把参考书拿走啦！」", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0823", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，能还给我吗」", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别把手伸过来啊你这臭虫！\\n　书还给你但是你要是碰到我的话我弄死你！」", "text_idx": 491, "plain": "「别把手伸过来啊你这臭虫！　书还给你但是你要是碰到我的话我弄死你！」", "plain_idx": 492, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0123", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈……来，濑名」", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……谢谢」", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0824", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过从另一方面来说不想被无视也是事实呢，\\n　从动物的角度来说你是怎么想的呢，熊喵」", "text_idx": 497, "plain": "「不过从另一方面来说不想被无视也是事实呢，　从动物的角度来说你是怎么想的呢，熊喵」", "plain_idx": 498, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0335", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～……」", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0075", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜，呜溜」", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0076", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吼吼！熊喵果然还是希望自己对新吾的爱得到双向奔赴的吧！」", "text_idx": 504, "plain": "「吼吼！熊喵果然还是希望自己对新吾的爱得到双向奔赴的吧！」", "plain_idx": 504, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0336", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜！」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0077", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀……等……别再靠过来啦」", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0825", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，不好意思啦熊喵。天羽学姐，交给你了」", "text_idx": 509, "plain": "「好了，不好意思啦熊喵。天羽学姐，交给你了」", "plain_idx": 509, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好~的，小熊喵这边来～\\n　呼呼，努力了这么长时间都没跟小爱亲近起来呢？」", "text_idx": 510, "plain": "「好~的，小熊喵这边来～　呼呼，努力了这么长时间都没跟小爱亲近起来呢？」", "plain_idx": 511, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0210", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就请让我来——」", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0398", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜——！」", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0078", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢樱乃，那么，濑名……」", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，嗯」", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0826", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样被大家热闹地包围着继续接受濑名的指导。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": "就这样被大家热闹地包围着继续接受濑名的指导。", "plain_idx": 521, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0827", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你看，瓜生。这里可有个秘诀哟」", "text_idx": 523, "plain": "「你看，瓜生。这里可有个秘诀哟」", "plain_idx": 523, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0828", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，等我记下来」", "text_idx": 525, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「做的不错，嗯，笔记要好好记。\\n　呼呼，顺带着这里也教你一下好了……」", "text_idx": 526, "plain": "「做的不错，嗯，笔记要好好记。　呼呼，顺带着这里也教你一下好了……」", "plain_idx": 527, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0829", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名看着我不断地接球，更加孜孜不倦地抛起球来。", "text_idx": 529, "plain": "濑名看着我不断地接球，更加孜孜不倦地抛起球来。", "plain_idx": 529, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，也被我毫无遗漏地接下了。", "text_idx": 530, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至于她如此热情的理由，我还是无从探求……", "text_idx": 531, "plain": "至于她如此热情的理由，我还是无从探求……", "plain_idx": 531, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但她的这种热心并没有让我感到反感。毕竟我也是男生嘛。", "text_idx": 532, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
